   "html": "<div class=\"se-viewer se-theme-default\" lang=\"ko-KR\">\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_START -->\n    <!--@CONTENTS_HEADER-->\n    <!-- SE_DOC_HEADER_END -->\n    <div class=\"se-main-container\">\n                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-7be596b7-b95f-43b3-820f-d74e9eb986e1\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content se-component-content-fit\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-image se-l-default se-section-align-\">\n                                <div class=\"se-module se-module-image\" style=\"\">\n                                    <a class=\"se-module-image-link __se_image_link __se_link\" style=\"\" onclick=\"return false;\" data-linktype=\"img\" data-linkdata=\"{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;SE-7be596b7-b95f-43b3-820f-d74e9eb986e1&quot;,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://shop-phinf.pstatic.net/20220209_250/1644392117527Y9kHD_JPEG/%EC%83%81%EB%8B%A8_%EC%95%88%EB%82%B4_001.jpg&quot;,&quot;originalWidth&quot;:&quot;860&quot;,&quot;originalHeight&quot;:&quot;243&quot;,&quot;linkUse&quot;:&quot;false&quot;,&quot;link&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;fileSize&quot;:&quot;56213&quot;}\">\n                                        <img src='data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAQAAAC1HAwCAAAAC0lEQVR42mP8/x8AAwMCAO+ip1sAAAAASUVORK5CYII=' data-src=\"https://shop-phinf.pstatic.net/20220209_250/1644392117527Y9kHD_JPEG/%EC%83%81%EB%8B%A8_%EC%95%88%EB%82%B4_001.jpg?type=w848\"  alt=\"\" class=\"se-image-resource\">\n                                    </a>\n                                </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module-v2=\"{&quot;type&quot;: &quot;v2_image&quot;, &quot;id&quot;: &quot;SE-7be596b7-b95f-43b3-820f-d74e9eb986e1&quot;, &quot;data&quot;: {&quot;ctype&quot;: &quot;image&quot;, &quot;ai&quot;: &quot;false&quot;, &quot;fileSize&quot;: &quot;56213&quot; }}\"></script>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"se-component se-text se-l-default\" id=\"SE-ee9f22d2-3608-4b26-9529-5a9f0faf127a\">\n                    <div class=\"se-component-content\">\n                        <div class=\"se-section se-section-text se-l-default\">\n                            <div class=\"se-module se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.5;\" id=\"SE-26b67ed6-7149-465f-a72e-aa0d4cb2444e\"><span style=\"color:#0a0a0a;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs24 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-182f71b7-d19a-4320-bd0a-d50dcfcb805b\">마루망(Maruman) 셔틀 NX-1 웨지는 아마추어 골퍼들이 편안하게 높은 탄도와 비거리를 낼 수 있도록 설계된 </span><span style=\"color:#0a0a0a;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs24 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-622f795c-e530-42e1-a102-7692a9494f9c\">초/중급자용 클럽입니다. </span></p><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.5;\" id=\"SE-4b8b22eb-e839-45e9-95da-54aed5435a88\"><span style=\"color:#0a0a0a;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs24 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-af3a1fa9-8cff-421d-81b3-51d944e8f84d\"><b>1. 주요 특징</b></span></p><ul class=\"se-text-list se-text-list-type-bullet-disc\"><li class=\"se-text-list-item\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.5;\" id=\"SE-2d273172-c899-4fbc-96e9-a30661b6db6c\"><span style=\"color:#0a0a0a;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs24 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-0f12a64a-a6f8-490e-aba5-c14974379b6d\"><b>슬랜트 그루브(Slant Groove) 기술:</b></span><span style=\"color:#0a0a0a;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs24 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-10ecb2ee-f5c1-4b01-827f-29f9544c4237\"> 솔(바닥) 내부에 비스듬한 그루브를 적용하여 미스 샷 시에도 지면을 쉽게 빠져나가며 헤드 스피드를 유지합니다.</span></p></li><li class=\"se-text-list-item\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.5;\" id=\"SE-a3094632-15ba-4aca-abba-c8cc4cc2e159\"><span style=\"color:#0a0a0a;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs24 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-980d0731-3edb-40b5-87ef-feaa14da41d3\"><b>낮은 중심 설계:</b></span><span style=\"color:#0a0a0a;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs24 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-94502cff-d5fc-4353-90f2-2665fe1bc09e\"> 17.6mm의 낮은 스윗스팟 높이와 짧은 넥 구조로 설계되어 공을 쉽게 띄우고 스트롱 로프트임에도 높은 발사각을 제공합니다.</span></p></li><li class=\"se-text-list-item\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.5;\" id=\"SE-cc55ce54-b276-4038-adb6-6f4482574d6f\"><span style=\"color:#0a0a0a;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs24 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-60054e63-3416-4a98-a573-6bceacefae76\"><b>스파이더웹 구조 페이스:</b></span><span style=\"color:#0a0a0a;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs24 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-d178c677-d5a4-4802-9ad0-a6bd45f5c6ef\"> 페이스의 반발 영역을 극대화하여 미스 히트 시에도 거리 손실을 최소화합니다.</span></p></li><li class=\"se-text-list-item\"><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"line-height:1.5;\" id=\"SE-1567b2db-071f-4fb2-aec3-0fae0655b7a6\"><span style=\"color:#0a0a0a;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs24 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-7ba0f557-e7c5-456a-961a-89e339fe6831\"><b>편안한 스윙:</b></span><span style=\"color:#0a0a0a;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs24 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-f17af188-a2fd-4ed9-a694-a675e8ccc1ec\"> 가벼운 중량으로 골퍼가 편안하게 사용할 수 있는 캐비티백 구조입니다</span><span style=\"color:#0a0a0a;background-color:#ffffff;\" class=\"se-fs-fs16 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" id=\"SE-53622964-1904-4660-8e11-cf0b4006f601\">. </span></p></li></ul><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module-v2=\"{&quot;type&quot;: &quot;v2_text&quot;, &quot;id&